        computer:`<div class="retro-c-drive-home"><header><b>C:</b><div><strong>DOORS SYSTEM MEMORY</strong><small>INDEXEDDB / LOCAL ORIGIN / PERSISTENT WHEN GRANTED</small></div><span data-c-drive-state>CONNECTING</span></header><div class="retro-c-drive-stats"><div><small>ROOM KEYS</small><b data-c-drive-count>-</b></div><div><small>USED MEMORY</small><b data-c-drive-used>-</b></div><div><small>STORAGE QUOTA</small><b data-c-drive-quota>-</b></div></div><div class="retro-c-drive-actions"><button type="button" data-open-keyring>Open Key Ring</button><button type="button" data-open-disk>Memory properties</button><button type="button" data-open-room-index>Enter Room Directory</button><button type="button" data-c-drive-persist>Request durable memory</button></div><div class="retro-c-drive-room-list"><b>ROOM MAP</b><span>RECEPTION · WORKSHOP · RECORDS · IMAGE STUDIO · OBSERVATORY · SIGNAL EXCHANGE · ARCADE · SERVICE WING · ODDITIES ANNEX · ROOM 00</span></div><p data-c-drive-report>C: is mounting its memory index.</p></div>`,
